{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|$Fyrdsman's Sword}}


==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}WroughtIron+ _{q}Wood}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>

* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 70*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Sword}/10}</math>.

